WEBVTT

00:09:59.483 --> 00:10:02.593
literally anything is possible.

00:10:04.264 --> 00:10:05.796
I was bought,

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.188
I was sold as a slave.

00:10:08.212 --> 00:10:10.432
But now I'm here,

00:10:10.456 --> 00:10:13.656
and that is why I believe in miracles.

00:10:15.462 --> 00:10:18.667
The one thing that I learned from history

00:10:18.691 --> 00:10:23.705
is that nothing is forever in this world.

00:10:23.729 --> 00:10:29.151
And that is why we have
every reason to be hopeful.

00:10:29.175 --> 00:10:30.605
Thank you.